ions of the equation ${x}^{2}-10x=-21.$ Find the value ${x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}.$ \n\n*Hint: Use the fact that ${x}^{2}-10x+25$ is a perfect square.*" :question/worked-solution "Using the hint, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-10x+25=(x-5{)}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-10x & =-21 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 5\\cdot x & =-21 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 5\\cdot x+{5}^{2}-{5}^{2} & =-21 \\\\ (x-5{)}^{2}-25 & =-21\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we isolate the perfect square by adding $25$ to both sides: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-5{)}^{2}-25+25 & =-21+25 \\\\ (x-5{)}^{2} & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now solve the equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-5{)}^{2} & =4 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x-5{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{4} \\\\ |x-5| & =2 \\\\ x-5 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =5\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =5-2=3 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =5+2=7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}={3}^{2}+{7}^{2}=58.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-142015/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c3e24f9c-d383-5b77-a22a-8e142a072f0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-142015"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804/selection/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" :answer/id #uuid "b8c8f138-1106-5b1c-8221-4f40ad94794d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "45" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804/selection/a84d639d380e10cb74c92005685f9f65779377dfb51342c280c63c645679bbea" :answer/id #uuid "1731cca0-c49f-5e4a-a366-a835aa56ef73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "4d9c6257-ab28-569a-93ed-62492947ecc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" :answer/id #uuid "c985eed4-45fd-5335-9a5c-383bfb554305" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804/selection/695792c47319cb1ed098a6d83038b7ad6d032838f9103d693bf346f1dc234ff8" :answer/id #uuid "63aa7789-1eaf-50a9-b251-82e1705cf17a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "40" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5d7b576a-7730-5f9e-a2fe-4a6ba8882703" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-141804/selection/695792c47319cb1ed098a6d83038b7ad6d032838f9103d693bf346f1dc234ff8" :answer-field/choices ["q-141804/selection/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" "q-141804/selection/a84d639d380e10cb74c92005685f9f65779377dfb51342c280c63c645679bbea" "q-141804/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" "q-141804/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" "q-141804/selection/695792c47319cb1ed098a6d83038b7ad6d032838f9103d693bf346f1dc234ff8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-141804" :question/id #uuid "eeb48fe4-90b0-5608-afdb-6e54e437040d" :question/math-academy-id "q-141804" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Let ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}$ be the solutions of the equation ${x}^{2}+4x=12.$ Find the value ${x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}.$ \n\n*Hint: Use the fact that ${x}^{2}+4x+4$ is a perfect square.*" :question/worked-solution "Using the hint, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+4x+4=(x+2{)}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+4x & =12 \\\\ {x}^{2}+2\\cdot 2\\cdot x & =12 \\\\ {x}^{2}+2\\cdot 2\\cdot x+{2}^{2}-{2}^{2} & =12 \\\\ (x+2{)}^{2}-4 & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we isolate the perfect square by adding $4$ to both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+2{)}^{2}-4+4 & =12+4 \\\\ (x+2{)}^{2} & =16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now solve the equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+2{)}^{2} & =16 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x+2{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{16} \\\\ |x+2| & =4 \\\\ x+2 & =\\pm 4 \\\\ x & =-2\\pm 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =-2-4=-6 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =-2+4=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}=(-6{)}^{2}+{2}^{2}=40.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-141804/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c3e24f9c-d383-5b77-a22a-8e142a072f0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141804"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420/selection/d6c91e006b5db973a5049151e115bca49ea51545bff381566cd8f9628be8b984" :answer/id #uuid "56b3793d-ee9e-5827-815a-9edc79cf0013" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=6,\\,x=-4$ and $x=-2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420/selection/eda266cc929c4769af9027a94bd9cc4b1d75fba1b4d5de9611c851bf61e3ae37" :answer/id #uuid "9749796f-d628-55cd-b5bb-9017fa3c375c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=4,\\,x=-6$ and $x=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420/selection/72e8fda5cab00bd524a5a3d1396f248cb520cd5e3c4ecf58355d3bffa6fe80eb" :answer/id #uuid "bfa0b688-6fce-58fc-988e-eb15d41877b0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=4,\\,x=-4$ and $x=-2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420/selection/90e2aa76f37bef54429db049549e4560f83e6d3073f51ccc675cec6821fd8215" :answer/id #uuid "83b19c52-4989-58cf-831b-2b17b33d843d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=3,\\,x=-2$ and $x=5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420/selection/811f243a1c9dff1ba68e4077d4551b90941dce8f90a5a0c8c85c502e4eb19ee7" :answer/id #uuid "365947dc-402e-5a3f-b3ac-e6696b612205" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=3,\\,x=-6$ and $x=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6e0b20a5-737e-57da-8567-68d9f0fe9477" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-112420/selection/72e8fda5cab00bd524a5a3d1396f248cb520cd5e3c4ecf58355d3bffa6fe80eb" :answer-field/choices ["q-112420/selection/d6c91e006b5db973a5049151e115bca49ea51545bff381566cd8f9628be8b984" "q-112420/selection/eda266cc929c4769af9027a94bd9cc4b1d75fba1b4d5de9611c851bf61e3ae37" "q-112420/selection/72e8fda5cab00bd524a5a3d1396f248cb520cd5e3c4ecf58355d3bffa6fe80eb" "q-112420/selection/90e2aa76f37bef54429db049549e4560f83e6d3073f51ccc675cec6821fd8215" "q-112420/selection/811f243a1c9dff1ba68e4077d4551b90941dce8f90a5a0c8c85c502e4eb19ee7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-112420" :question/id #uuid "e4526888-3995-5c7b-92cb-b5eeb975e983" :question/math-academy-id "q-112420" :question/is-example false :question/problem "The equation ${x}^{2}+6x+8=0$ can be written in the form $(x+p{)}^{2}=q.$ Find $\\,p+q,$ and solve the equation." :question/worked-solution "First, we move the constant term to the right-hand side and complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+6x+8 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+6x & =-8 \\\\ {x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3\\cdot x & =-8 \\\\ {x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3\\cdot x+{3}^{2}-{3}^{2} & =-8 \\\\ ({x}^{2}+2\\cdot 3\\cdot x+{3}^{2})-9 & =-8 \\\\ (x+3{)}^{2}-9 & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we isolate the perfect square and solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+3{)}^{2}-9 & =-8 \\\\ (x+3{)}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $p=3,q=1,$ and $p+q=4.$\n\nNext, we solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+3{)}^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x+3{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{1} \\\\ x+3 & =\\pm 1 \\\\ x & =-3\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-3+1=-2 \\\\ x & =-3-1=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=-4$ and $x=-2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-112420/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d78ba1c-5297-5540-afdc-d419d33e0cf7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-112420"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997/selection/d5884914ddc768729c8c26c6ee8f9198a6504b34be3e623e34a56c37c1f0364b" :answer/id #uuid "a9137188-8a26-51e8-9692-83ef454a2aa5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=64,\\,a=-12$ and $a=-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997/selection/b94d1ebc00da720d42398a3406c1a29d24e4fc83fd40696c4fac4f23295242df" :answer/id #uuid "50da7842-a22f-58aa-ab23-0cf66e072979" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=60,\\,a=12$ and $a=-8$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997/selection/cd17b3ea41be71b3ae2da5ff1785245ce9f7bfefc5477c5980a3e8a81c6b209e" :answer/id #uuid "6280936c-103a-5995-a127-cb88e7bf1b06" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=68,\\,a=-12$ and $a=4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997/selection/512a399024f830263a7b3f06cef2ef350b01998a227331ade956dca466e0827a" :answer/id #uuid "37fa95e0-fa7d-5fec-aa9f-88a4eb40df8d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=64,\\,a=-12$ and $a=4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997/selection/55fb5678344bc9094256b5e84a2f924b6830912dfbe921c634ec57822a5bb3f0" :answer/id #uuid "85ded79c-b9cd-584d-bc84-266e7e52728d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=68,\\,a=12$ and $a=-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "50e262aa-c58a-5075-8d70-5f4327bb17f9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-12997/selection/cd17b3ea41be71b3ae2da5ff1785245ce9f7bfefc5477c5980a3e8a81c6b209e" :answer-field/choices ["q-12997/selection/d5884914ddc768729c8c26c6ee8f9198a6504b34be3e623e34a56c37c1f0364b" "q-12997/selection/b94d1ebc00da720d42398a3406c1a29d24e4fc83fd40696c4fac4f23295242df" "q-12997/selection/cd17b3ea41be71b3ae2da5ff1785245ce9f7bfefc5477c5980a3e8a81c6b209e" "q-12997/selection/512a399024f830263a7b3f06cef2ef350b01998a227331ade956dca466e0827a" "q-12997/selection/55fb5678344bc9094256b5e84a2f924b6830912dfbe921c634ec57822a5bb3f0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-12997" :question/id #uuid "4870cb8f-66f0-5759-83b5-334830749092" :question/math-academy-id "q-12997" :question/is-example false :question/problem "The equation ${a}^{2}+8a=48$ can be written in the form $(a+p{)}^{2}=q.$ Find $p+q,$ and solve the equation." :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}^{2}+8a & =48 \\\\ {a}^{2}+2\\cdot 4\\cdot a & =48 \\\\ {a}^{2}+2\\cdot 4\\cdot a+{4}^{2}-{4}^{2} & =48 \\\\ ({a}^{2}+2\\cdot 4\\cdot a+{4}^{2})-16 & =48 \\\\ {(a+4)}^{2}-16 & =48\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we isolate the perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(a+4{)}^{2}-16 & =48 \\\\ (a+4{)}^{2} & =64\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $p=4,q=64,$ and $p+q=68.$\n\nNext, we solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(a+4{)}^{2} & =64 \\\\ \\sqrt{(a+4{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{64} \\\\ a+4 & =\\pm 8 \\\\ a & =-4\\pm 8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $a=-12$ and $a=4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-12997/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d78ba1c-5297-5540-afdc-d419d33e0cf7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-12997"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428/selection/74bdc8ba7cb1511eda819a4db10d7f6c4f23ea1ea5d7ebad4802e78fd8ab02d1" :answer/id #uuid "2cb7614c-f998-549f-b51e-0f30b1e86f82" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=-29\\,,\\,\\,a=1$ and $a=-9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428/selection/fbf8c737bdb112e194a0ab6e8b181d3e11b663a0567a5db12ca6b01463c47491" :answer/id #uuid "42322171-7411-590f-a373-5532e097c98a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=21\\,,\\,\\,a=1$ and $a=-9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428/selection/3ee78f7da4cfa69586f93a88563c535d1a2659534d5a450cb4155fffa8bed78b" :answer/id #uuid "86f767c2-4e0b-5c65-bdc0-74f4f9d051e8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=29\\,,\\,\\,a=1$ and $a=9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428/selection/9f12dde20e7a26df8486f7ed9b85c28be3d9323a745be8aa575d77feafe89a7c" :answer/id #uuid "d6d29bf8-0c33-51eb-9878-198f160be1b1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=21\\,,\\,\\,a=1$ and $a=9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428/selection/d0dc15c42e2175adc61f710dd82cdbef032bfda6218319fe5db697e38852368d" :answer/id #uuid "afc9de7b-9ff3-5070-8862-cbcc7ae0b8c7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=29\\,,\\,\\,a=1$ and $a=-9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f144556b-4d18-517f-9a4d-a92e8b834c32" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-3428/selection/d0dc15c42e2175adc61f710dd82cdbef032bfda6218319fe5db697e38852368d" :answer-field/choices ["q-3428/selection/74bdc8ba7cb1511eda819a4db10d7f6c4f23ea1ea5d7ebad4802e78fd8ab02d1" "q-3428/selection/fbf8c737bdb112e194a0ab6e8b181d3e11b663a0567a5db12ca6b01463c47491" "q-3428/selection/3ee78f7da4cfa69586f93a88563c535d1a2659534d5a450cb4155fffa8bed78b" "q-3428/selection/9f12dde20e7a26df8486f7ed9b85c28be3d9323a745be8aa575d77feafe89a7c" "q-3428/selection/d0dc15c42e2175adc61f710dd82cdbef032bfda6218319fe5db697e38852368d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-3428" :question/id #uuid "6941a5b9-c275-5c15-8bac-323a4f9103c3" :question/math-academy-id "q-3428" :question/is-example false :question/problem "The equation ${a}^{2}+8a=9$ can be written in the form $(a+p{)}^{2}=q.$ Find $\\,p+q,$ and solve the equation." :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}^{2}+8a & =9 \\\\ {a}^{2}+2\\cdot a\\cdot 4 & =9 \\\\ {a}^{2}+2\\cdot a\\cdot 4+{4}^{2}-{4}^{2} & =9 \\\\ ({a}^{2}+2\\cdot a\\cdot 4+{4}^{2})-{4}^{2} & =9 \\\\ ({a}^{2}+2\\cdot a\\cdot 4+{4}^{2})-16 & =9 \\\\ (a+4{)}^{2}-16 & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we isolate the perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(a+4{)}^{2}-16 & =9 \\\\ (a+4{)}^{2} & =25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $p=4,q=25,$ and $p+q=29.$\n\nNow, we solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(a+4{)}^{2} & =25 \\\\ \\sqrt{(a+4{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\ a+4 & =\\pm 5 \\\\ a & =-4\\pm 5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =-4+5=1 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =-4-5=-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $a=1$ and $a=-9.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-3428/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d78ba1c-5297-5540-afdc-d419d33e0cf7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-3428"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457/selection/e6e38396a239b96245682f8c4870743f73d4b19ca4dac82e07060dc8bd27b66c" :answer/id #uuid "c9ff0da9-065e-5e0d-9c46-1cec8c68dfad" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$pq=-343\\,$ and $\\,{t}_{1}+{t}_{2}=14$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457/selection/992e243681650f4ac292044aee6f4f8f8e8511c12a77ca20b89cbad3a675a903" :answer/id #uuid "a22121fc-7605-5e14-ace2-399261387fff" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$pq=-14\\,$ and $\\,{t}_{1}+{t}_{2}=49$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457/selection/5fdc2c6ae8bf1f63ffe96191b6d430c00f01dcbf5592c9cdd9ca44a95dfb639d" :answer/id #uuid "db694b16-0ebe-5b6b-a951-b60a653a5624" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$pq=-264\\,$ and $\\,{t}_{1}+{t}_{2}=-14$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457/selection/7a31257e19bafeea6c9a22fd9c98b8266dd2a204cd9ee3a371b1d98582a3f3d2" :answer/id #uuid "2dd923bc-a32e-5d3b-9222-f1df6768ef37" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$pq=343\\,$ and $\\,{t}_{1}+{t}_{2}=-14$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457/selection/c6641a0f966e759926124877626ccb2cbfbb4ed82f69401067ecc7b9b70b7c4e" :answer/id #uuid "0ca190bb-5f09-5b2e-bbb6-6947ce63112f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$pq=-343\\,$ and $\\,{t}_{1}+{t}_{2}=-14$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7e4805a1-c529-5b08-b948-27428d7a12e6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-112457/selection/e6e38396a239b96245682f8c4870743f73d4b19ca4dac82e07060dc8bd27b66c" :answer-field/choices ["q-112457/selection/e6e38396a239b96245682f8c4870743f73d4b19ca4dac82e07060dc8bd27b66c" "q-112457/selection/992e243681650f4ac292044aee6f4f8f8e8511c12a77ca20b89cbad3a675a903" "q-112457/selection/5fdc2c6ae8bf1f63ffe96191b6d430c00f01dcbf5592c9cdd9ca44a95dfb639d" "q-112457/selection/7a31257e19bafeea6c9a22fd9c98b8266dd2a204cd9ee3a371b1d98582a3f3d2" "q-112457/selection/c6641a0f966e759926124877626ccb2cbfbb4ed82f69401067ecc7b9b70b7c4e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-112457" :question/id #uuid "fac39442-17f5-5ace-9954-931f61698611" :question/math-academy-id "q-112457" :question/is-example false :question/problem "The equation ${t}^{2}-14t+5=5$ can be written in the form $(t+p{)}^{2}=q.$ Find $\\,pq\\,,$ and the sum of the roots ${t}_{1}+{t}_{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we move the constant term to the right-hand side and complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{2}-14t+5 & =5 \\\\ {t}^{2}-14t & =0 \\\\ {t}^{2}-2\\cdot t\\cdot 7+{7}^{2}-{7}^{2} & =0 \\\\ (t-7{)}^{2}-{7}^{2} & =0 \\\\ (t-7{)}^{2} & =49\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $p=-7$ and $q=49.$ Thus, $pq=-343.$\n\nWe now solve the equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(t-7{)}^{2} & =49 \\\\ \\sqrt{(t-7{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{49} \\\\ |t-7| & =7 \\\\ t-7 & =\\pm 7 \\\\ t & =7\\pm 7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}_{1} & =7-7=0 \\\\ {t}_{2} & =7+7=14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sum is ${t}_{1}+{t}_{2}=14.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-112457/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d78ba1c-5297-5540-afdc-d419d33e0cf7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-112457"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048/selection/5dcb9b8545482ed647228c02ba8a8a4c49961df1757d9648d877aea352cb913c" :answer/id #uuid "bba6d4c4-1382-535f-90b6-7e37feca6761" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=100,\\,x=-11$ and $x=-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048/selection/d122ba60fe10183c2af1a10e9266d0123ddc67073985180795f3a5e6886f11d1" :answer/id #uuid "f16afde8-4951-5710-bfc0-e153070d1de9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=111,\\,x=-1$ and $x=21$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048/selection/4a2086a19d5f82aafce94d0e1eebd1b896a995aa5c5ae1892eb54e9165ea8f03" :answer/id #uuid "5c682bea-ffc0-513c-a21b-6624e9ee1f46" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=121,\\,x=-1$ and $x=21$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048/selection/94378b2d56d998bfdbdb306c522dc37a55f8205fcdbdaa8153346c216f7fa878" :answer/id #uuid "786349b6-d7e5-5c46-9efa-c46d3fee009e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=101,\\,x=1$ and $x=11$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048/selection/5f75e074b5cfa7d4c8e9a7ec0d07b8a654675f7900018b9a6d578d6a95271118" :answer/id #uuid "62763fb4-d482-542b-b1c0-6f8a1af4465e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$p+q=111,\\,x=-11$ and $x=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3bdb649-16b7-5a07-a1c8-956d3595c6e8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-30048/selection/d122ba60fe10183c2af1a10e9266d0123ddc67073985180795f3a5e6886f11d1" :answer-field/choices ["q-30048/selection/5dcb9b8545482ed647228c02ba8a8a4c49961df1757d9648d877aea352cb913c" "q-30048/selection/d122ba60fe10183c2af1a10e9266d0123ddc67073985180795f3a5e6886f11d1" "q-30048/selection/4a2086a19d5f82aafce94d0e1eebd1b896a995aa5c5ae1892eb54e9165ea8f03" "q-30048/selection/94378b2d56d998bfdbdb306c522dc37a55f8205fcdbdaa8153346c216f7fa878" "q-30048/selection/5f75e074b5cfa7d4c8e9a7ec0d07b8a654675f7900018b9a6d578d6a95271118"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-30048" :question/id #uuid "cb10d5e7-799c-59f9-9941-681a23b9a8bd" :question/math-academy-id "q-30048" :question/is-example false :question/problem "The equation ${x}^{2}-20x-21=0$ can be written in the form $(x+p{)}^{2}=q.$ Find $\\,p+q,$ and solve the equation." :question/worked-solution "First, we move the constant term to the right-hand side and complete the square on the left-hand side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-20x-21 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-20x & =21 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 10\\cdot x & =21 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2\\cdot 10\\cdot x+{10}^{2}-{10}^{2} & =21 \\\\ ({x}^{2}-2\\cdot 10\\cdot x+{10}^{2})-100 & =21 \\\\ (x-10{)}^{2}-100 & =21\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we isolate the perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-10{)}^{2}-100 & =21 \\\\ (x-10{)}^{2} & =121\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $p=-10,q=121,$ and $p+q=111.$\n\nNow, we solve the equation using the square-root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-10{)}^{2} & =121 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x-10{)}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{121} \\\\ x-10 & =\\pm 11 \\\\ x & =10\\pm 11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe simplify the two solutions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =10+11=21 \\\\ x & =10-11=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solutions are $x=-1$ and $x=21.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-30048/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d78ba1c-5297-5540-afdc-d419d33e0cf7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-30048"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-112466/